        "comments": "The assembly cjSouToph1.1 is based on 43x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 1 (182,427 - 183,785 Kbp) are unknown. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 4 (27,353 ? 30,285c Kbp) are unknown.",
